The following images in docs/img/ contain frames from the RAVDESS dataset
(Livingstone & Russo, 2018, https://zenodo.org/records/1188976) and are
licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/):

  docs/img/rosto_real_ravdess.png
  docs/img/malha_ravdess.png
  docs/img/quadros_real.png

The chart docs/img/linha_do_tempo_malha.png and docs/img/linha_do_tempo_real.png
contain no RAVDESS frames, only measurements derived from them.

docs/img/video_real_trecho_B.png contains measurements derived from
"Interview on extreme weather with physical geographer Hannah Cloke",
The Royal Society, CC BY 3.0 (via Wikimedia Commons).

Models downloaded at runtime (YuNet from the OpenCV Zoo, MediaPipe Face
Landmarker) are not distributed with this repository and keep their own
licenses.
